Package: libflagdnn-nvidia
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         libpython3.12 (>= 3.12),
         libtriton-jit-nvidia (>= 0.1.0-3),
         python3,
         python3-yaml
Description: FlagDNN native graph runtime (NVIDIA backend)
 FlagDNN provides a native C/C++ graph runtime and a dynamically loaded NVIDIA
 backend using CUDA and the system Triton JIT runtime. This package contains
 the shared libraries, compiler providers, kernels, registries, and tuning data.

Package: libflagdnn-nvidia-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         libflagdnn-nvidia (= ${binary:Version}),
         libtriton-jit-nvidia-dev (>= 0.1.0-3)
Description: FlagDNN development files (NVIDIA backend)
 C/C++ headers and CMake package files for applications using FlagDNN.
